            'Maroc PC ships computer components, accessories, and eligible build orders across supported Moroccan delivery zones. Some bulky or fragile items may need extra handling confirmation before dispatch.' => 'Maroc PC expédie des composants et configurations au Maroc. Les articles volumineux/fragiles peuvent nécessiter une confirmation supplémentaire.',
            'Standard delivery: best for normal orders and non-urgent components.' => 'Livraison standard : idéale pour les commandes normales et non urgentes.',
            'Express delivery: faster handling when available for your address and item type.' => 'Livraison express : traitement plus rapide lorsque disponible.',
            'Cash on delivery: may require confirmation before dispatch and may not be available for every order value or destination.' => 'Paiement à la livraison : peut nécessiter une confirmation avant expédition.',
            'Store pickup or special handling may be arranged by support for sensitive hardware when available.' => 'Le retrait en magasin peut être organisé pour le matériel sensible.',
            'Orders are reviewed for payment status, stock reservation, and address completeness before dispatch.' => 'Les commandes sont examinées avant expédition.',
            'PC build services, BIOS updates, Windows/Linux installation, and stress testing can add preparation time.' => 'Les services d\'assemblage et les tests peuvent ajouter du temps de préparation.',
            'Orders placed late in the day, during weekends, or during holidays may begin processing the next business day.' => 'Les commandes passées tard ou les week-ends seront traitées le jour ouvrable suivant.',
            'Sign in and open My Orders from your account page to see order status and history.' => 'Connectez-vous et ouvrez Mes Commandes pour voir l\'état.',
            'Status can include pending, processing, shipped, out for delivery, delivered, or cancelled.' => 'L\'état peut inclure : en attente, en traitement, expédié, livré, etc.',
            'If tracking does not update after dispatch, contact support with your order number.' => 'Si le suivi ne se met pas à jour, contactez l\'assistance.',
            'Inspect the package before opening when possible.' => 'Inspectez le colis avant de l\'ouvrir.',
            'Keep packaging, labels, foam, seals, and accessories until the issue is resolved.' => 'Conservez l\'emballage jusqu\'à la résolution du problème.',
            'Report damaged parcels or missing items through Returns & Refunds within 24 hours when possible.' => 'Signalez les colis endommagés dans les 24 heures.',
            'Send photos of the outer parcel, shipping label, product box, and affected item to support@marocpc.com.' => 'Envoyez des photos à support@marocpc.com.',
            'Wrong address, unreachable phone number, failed COD confirmation, or refused delivery can delay or cancel shipment.' => 'Une mauvaise adresse ou l\'impossibilité de vous joindre peut retarder l\'expédition.',
            'If a delivery attempt fails, contact support quickly so the order can be redirected or rescheduled where possible.' => 'Si une livraison échoue, contactez-nous pour reprogrammer.',
            'Refunds for undelivered orders depend on payment status, courier return, and order cancellation review.' => 'Les remboursements pour les commandes non livrées dépendent du retour du coursier.',
            'We collect the information needed to run an online computer hardware store and provide after-sales support.' => 'Nous collectons les informations nécessaires pour gérer la boutique et fournir l\'assistance.',
            'Account information: name, email, hashed password, email verification status, loyalty tier, and security settings.' => 'Informations de compte : nom, email, mot de passe haché, etc.',
            'Order information: items purchased, shipping and billing addresses, payment method, transaction reference, order status, and delivery estimate.' => 'Informations de commande : articles, adresse, paiement.',
            'Support information: after-sales tickets, return/refund details, warranty details, serial numbers when provided, and messages sent to support.' => 'Informations d\'assistance : tickets, retours, garantie.',
            'Store activity: wishlist items, saved PC builds, product reviews, review votes, restock notifications, and newsletter subscriptions.' => 'Activité en boutique : liste de souhaits, avis, etc.',
            'Technical data: session cookies, CSRF tokens, browser/device basics, and logs needed to secure and debug the site.' => 'Données techniques : cookies, sécurité, logs.',
            'Create and secure your Maroc PC account.' => 'Créer et sécuriser votre compte.',
            'Process orders, reserve stock, calculate loyalty points, and send order emails.' => 'Traiter les commandes et réserver les stocks.',
            'Handle returns, refunds, warranty claims, damaged parcels, and missing-item reports.' => 'Gérer les retours, les garanties et les remboursements.',
            'Show saved builds, wishlists, reviews, and account history.' => 'Afficher les configurations sauvegardées et l\'historique.',
            'Send verification, password reset, two-factor, order, newsletter, and support emails.' => 'Envoyer les e-mails de vérification et d\'assistance.',
            'Prevent fraud, abuse, duplicate payment issues, unauthorized access, and account misuse.' => 'Prévenir la fraude et l\'accès non autorisé.',
            'Payment information is used to complete checkout and track payment status. The current checkout supports simulated card/payment flows and order references. If a real payment processor is connected later, sensitive card data should be handled by that payment provider rather than stored directly by Maroc PC.' => 'Les données de paiement sont gérées par le fournisseur.',
            'We share information only when needed to operate the store, deliver orders, provide support, or comply with legal obligations.' => 'Nous ne partageons les informations qu\'en cas de besoin pour la boutique.',
            'Delivery partners may receive shipping contact and address information.' => 'Les partenaires de livraison reçoivent l\'adresse.',
            'Email providers may process transactional emails such as verification, password reset, and order updates.' => 'Les fournisseurs d\'e-mails traitent les messages.',
            'Payment providers may process payment data when a live payment method is used.' => 'Les fournisseurs de paiement traitent le paiement.',
            'Manufacturers or distributors may receive warranty details, serial numbers, and fault descriptions for service cases.' => 'Les fabricants peuvent recevoir les détails de la garantie.',
            'Order records are kept for business, tax, support, and warranty tracking.' => 'Les enregistrements de commande sont conservés.',
            'Password reset and email verification tokens expire and are marked used or deleted after use.' => 'Les jetons expirent après utilisation.',
            'After-sales tickets are kept to document service history and warranty decisions.' => 'Les tickets d\'assistance sont conservés pour l\'historique.',
            'Deleted accounts may enter a short restoration period before permanent cleanup, as shown in the account deletion flow.' => 'Les comptes supprimés peuvent avoir un délai de restauration.',
            'You can update profile details from your account page.' => 'Vous pouvez mettre à jour votre profil depuis votre compte.',
            'You can delete or restore your account from the security/account area when available.' => 'Vous pouvez supprimer ou restaurer votre compte.',
            'You can request support for privacy, order, or account questions at support@marocpc.com.' => 'Vous pouvez demander de l\'aide à support@marocpc.com.',
            'You can control cookies and local storage through your browser settings, but some site features may stop working.' => 'Vous pouvez contrôler les cookies dans les paramètres du navigateur.',
            'By using Maroc PC, creating an account, placing an order, saving a build, posting a review, or opening a support ticket, you agree to these terms.' => 'En utilisant Maroc PC, vous acceptez ces conditions.',
            'You must provide accurate account, delivery, billing, and contact information.' => 'Vous devez fournir des informations exactes.',
            'You are responsible for keeping your account credentials secure.' => 'Vous êtes responsable de vos identifiants.',
            'You may not abuse checkout, loyalty, reviews, wishlist, builder, or after-sales systems.' => 'Vous ne devez pas abuser des systèmes de la boutique.',
            'Product images, specifications, ratings, stock, discounts, and compatibility notes are provided for shopping guidance.' => 'Les images et notes sont fournies à titre indicatif.',
            'Prices are shown in DH and may change before an order is placed.' => 'Les prix sont en DH et peuvent changer.',
            'Stock is reserved when an order is placed and may be restored if an order is cancelled or deleted according to store rules.' => 'Le stock est réservé lors d\'une commande.',
            'If a product is incorrectly priced or unavailable because of a technical error, Maroc PC may correct the order before fulfillment.' => 'En cas d\'erreur technique, Maroc PC peut corriger la commande.',
            'A checkout order may be pending, processing, shipped, delivered, or cancelled.' => 'La commande peut avoir divers statuts.',
            'Payment status may be pending, paid, failed, or refunded depending on payment method and support action.' => 'Le statut du paiement peut changer.',
            'Orders may be cancelled for failed payment, unavailable stock, suspected fraud, incorrect details, or customer request before dispatch.' => 'Les commandes peuvent être annulées.',
            'The PC builder, AI assistant, FPS estimator, and compatibility messages help with selection but do not replace final technical inspection.' => 'Les outils ne remplacent pas une vérification technique.',
            'Compatibility is checked from available product data such as socket, memory type, wattage, and stock.' => 'La compatibilité est vérifiée à partir des données.',
            'Final assembly, BIOS updates, thermal checks, and case clearance may still require technician review.' => 'L\'assemblage final peut nécessiter un technicien.',
            'Quotes and saved builds are not guaranteed reservations until products are placed in an order and stock is confirmed.' => 'Les devis ne garantissent pas les réservations.',
            'Reviews should be truthful, relevant, and based on real product experience.' => 'Les avis doivent être vrais et pertinents.',
            'Maroc PC may moderate reviews for spam, abuse, personal data, fraud, or irrelevant content.' => 'Maroc PC peut modérer les avis.',
            'By submitting content, you allow Maroc PC to display it on the store unless removed or moderated.' => 'Vous nous autorisez à afficher votre contenu.',
            'Eligible returns and exchanges should be requested through the Returns & Refunds page.' => 'Demandez un retour via la page dédiée.',
            'Refunds depend on eligibility, inspection, payment status, and product completeness.' => 'Les remboursements dépendent de l\'éligibilité.',
            'Warranty cases may require serial numbers, photos, diagnostics, and manufacturer approval.' => 'La garantie nécessite une validation.',
            'Damaged parcels and missing items should be reported as soon as possible, ideally within 24 hours of delivery.' => 'Signalez les colis endommagés sous 24h.',
            'Maroc PC works to keep the store accurate and available, but temporary errors, downtime, stock changes, or content mistakes can happen. These terms may be updated as the store evolves.' => 'Maroc PC s\'efforce de maintenir la boutique à jour.'
